1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,333
Noon. Your mouth is glue. Sam walks to
the waves with his hands cupped.

2
00:00:04,833 --> 00:00:06,967
Rule four. Never drink the sea.

3
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:13,133
Seawater is saltier than your blood.
Your body spends more water getting
rid of it than you drank.

4
00:00:13,633 --> 00:00:15,367
So the whole ocean is a trap.

5
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:19,133
You have half a bottle between you.
Drink it now, or save it?

6
00:00:19,633 --> 00:00:25,133
Drink it. Water in your body keeps you
thinking. Water in a bottle just
watches you die.
